I think I've found a bug in vanilla nethack, in how 
wands of digging interact with graves: 

If you dig downwards on a grave, you may dig up a 
corpse or a zombie or another monster. Depending 
on your alignment and role, your alignment record 
may be affected. If you zap a wand of digging 
downwards onto a grave, the same thing happens. 
But if you BREAK a wand of digging instead, it 
just creates pits.

I have patched this bug on dnethack, and the 
